  <item>
    <title>Vol.23💍关于求婚的时机、心态与避雷指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68eb312b224325ea70caf509</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68eb312b224325ea70caf509</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 04:47:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们将首次完整分享我们自己的求婚故事。那是一个充满“没想到”的一天——没想到的时间、没想到的地点、没想到的见证人，以及惊喜之下，那份欣慰、慌张又带点“小遗憾”的复杂心情。而“主谋”奥斯卡，也将公开他为了这场求婚“蓄谋已久”的全过程。你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> 复盘求婚日：一切都从“没想到”开始</span><em><span>（现场图片见xhs：可可斑斓）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 求婚当天奥斯卡和闺蜜露出的一些马脚🫣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 🐢奥斯卡笨拙的拖延时间方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 来到奥斯卡布置的求婚现场，可可整个人都是懵逼的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 奥斯卡揭秘：求婚大作战的幕后准备与心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 奥斯卡为什么选在「7周年」纪念日求婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 探讨🤔：两个人恋爱到什么阶段，适合求婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 事后畅想：我们理想中的求婚场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> 划重点：男士求婚一定要注意的细节‼️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2514">41:54</a> 男生愿意被求婚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉 也欢迎大家在评论区或粉丝群，分享你听过的、经历过的，关于求婚的趣事与感动！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgoI1oLzf2AS5RYnayPnA4I4jYi.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666a8b71b6a84127296fa52e/lrdxhBHrxwGXKq2CXiYG4WHU8tkr.m4a" length="45484843" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPsEY10yyg737j2ubgJKT03BIL2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.22💸除了工资，能治愈打工人的还有它们｜好物分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c55322a56ca3e0c4364f18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c55322a56ca3e0c4364f18</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Sep 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们盘点了近期入手的让我们快乐的好东西，全程无广，放心收听！我们希望这些好物也能给你带来一些灵感和便利，提升生活中的幸福感。如果你对某件好物感兴趣，欢迎在评论区留言或加入我们的听友群，我们很乐意与你分享！你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💻 数码电子</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a></span></code><strong><span>MacBook：</span></strong><span> 叠加国补，真香～</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a></span></code><strong><span>半入耳式降噪耳机：</span></strong><span> 颜值满分💯，展会、通勤环境音的克星！</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a></span></code><strong><span>自带插头充电宝：</span></strong><span> 出行充电化繁为简，年度最方便！</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a></span></code><strong><span>超薄手机支架：</span></strong><span> 性价比拉满的好用📱支架</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🧺 居家神器</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a></span></code><strong><span>迷你洗衣机：</span></strong><span> 解放我俩双手的、使用率超高的小家电！</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a></span></code><strong><span>多功能彩色水桶：</span></strong><span> 不被定义的彩色水桶，也许是水桶，也许是醒花桶，也许是垃圾桶...</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a></span></code><strong><span>真空收纳袋</span></strong><span>：换季必备！让衣柜空间瞬间翻倍的魔法</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">39:13</a></span></code><strong><span>檀木按摩器：</span></strong><span> 睡前刮一刮，放松一整天。</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a></span></code><strong><span>运动鞋除臭喷雾：</span></strong><span> 夏日必备，给鞋柜来一次“空气净化”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a></span></code><strong><span>白鞋清洁湿巾：</span></strong><span> 小白鞋的“一擦即亮”橡皮擦。</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a></span></code><strong><span>一次性清洁巾：</span></strong><span> 随用随扔！轻松对付厨房油污</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a></span></code><strong><span>充气U型枕</span></strong><span>：旅行途中也能秒睡的秘密，收纳起来超轻便</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a></span></code><strong><span>鲜花包装袋：</span></strong><span> DIY一束独一无二的花，让心意取代过度包装</span></li><span>  </span><li><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a></span></code><strong><span>电商会员（京东/淘宝）：</span></strong><span> 不是广告！一买就回本的省钱利器。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqc3Q7GhqiBlJo2jPMI5p1O36oSY.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>👉 也欢迎大家在评论区或粉丝群，分享近期让你们开心的好物！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgoI1oLzf2AS5RYnayPnA4I4jYi.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666a8b71b6a84127296fa52e/ltKgDn93Z1TdecF9Yyrz6ZYfBqG8.m4a" length="57616110" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPsEY10yyg737j2ubgJKT03BIL2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.21🚨「血压飙升」：爆胎×追尾×堵路，奥斯卡炸了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a09727293471fed4f0b937</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a09727293471fed4f0b937</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好！本期节目是我们的全新栏目——《血压飙升》系列！主要聊的就是生活中那些让我们</span><strong><span>血压狂飙、情绪原地爆炸</span></strong><span>的时刻（担心不说出来会长结节）。今天我们首先要分享的是「交通风云」主题，包含3个亲身经历的马路崩溃瞬间，希望听完这期，你下次遇到突发交通状况时能淡定一点（虽然我们自己当时完全没淡定哈哈哈）。你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 第一次爆胎+手机没电，奥斯卡血压控不住了💥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 大排面！交警&amp;保险两辆拖车把我们拖走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 后怕时刻：轮胎碾过的不只是路面...是存款！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 其实一切没那么坏，保持乐观，生活总是赢赢赢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 深夜追尾：善良司机反被坑😭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 求求大家一定要在车上留电话号码啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> 可可的奇怪怒点</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎁</span></strong><span>附赠保命避坑指南</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjoFIYQa1CUy80WbnHGcLxd332xp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>👉 也欢迎大家在评论区或粉丝群，分享你们的“血压飙升瞬间”！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgoI1oLzf2AS5RYnayPnA4I4jYi.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666a8b71b6a84127296fa52e/ls9EoJln8ug-eqTtnh5-9SyffM7U.m4a" length="38160316" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPsEY10yyg737j2ubgJKT03BIL2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
